WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.455
An executive assistant works within a connected system The

00:00:04.468 --> 00:00:10.271
executive makes decisions within their authority Finance operations and

00:00:10.323 --> 00:00:14.810
other specialists remain responsible for their own decisions The

00:00:14.836 --> 00:00:18.810
executive protection officer and independent control room also have

00:00:18.876 --> 00:00:23.770
defined responsibilities Your role is to organise dependable support

00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:27.376
make missing information visible and obtain the decisions or

00:00:27.376 --> 00:00:31.626
acceptance that an arrangement requires This course does not

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.981
give you specialist powers or replace your workplace mandate
